	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"MGシリーズとして、TVシリーズ「機動戦士ガンダム」に登場する「グフ」が遂に登場。右手にはヒートロッド、左手には5連マシンガンを装備。ヒートロッドは3重構造製で自由に曲げられます。また、コックピットなど各部内部メカも再現。1/20のクラウレ・ハモンのフィギュアが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"As part of the MG series, \"Gouf\" that appears in the TV series \"Mobile Suit Gundam\" has finally appeared. Equipped with a heat rod in the right hand and a 5-barreled machine gun in the left hand. The heat rod is made of triple structure and can be bent freely. In addition, the internal mechanisms of various parts such as the cockpit are also reproduced. A 1/20 Claure Hamon figure is included."
		]
	},
